        <body>
            <div xml:id="d172">

                <pb facs="0255" n="155" xml:id="pg155"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">812.00/24225a: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the Chargé in Mexico</hi>
                        (<hi rendition="#italic">Summerlin</hi>)</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1920-06-19T13:00:00-04:00"><hi rendition="#italic">June 19, 1920—1
                                p.m.</hi></date></dateline></opener>
                <p>173. Navy Department has ordered withdrawal of all naval units in Mexican
                    territorial waters, except cruiser <hi rendition="#italic">Des Moines</hi> and
                    two destroyers in Gulf, and one destroyer on west coast.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Colby</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
